        "text_kd69Kz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At isoua, we believe in <strong>one of everything good that really works.</strong></p><p>Rooted in science and thoughtful formulation, we create effective, accessible skincare designed to earn a place in your everyday routine. From a really good mask or serum to a moisturiser or blush, every product is made to become a go-to—something you reach for daily and never want to leave behind when you travel.</p><p>My journey with PCOS and cystic acne inspired me to create a simpler approach to skincare: products that cut through the noise and focus on what truly matters.</p><p>Built on science-led formulations, isoua is about doing more with less. Our essentials are designed with acne-prone and sensitive skin in mind, helping support skin that feels clear, calm, hydrated, and balanced through its changing needs.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "center",
